{"key":"map/gz1g","relations":[{"id":"person","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/firez","title":"Firez","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/hwleader","title":"Hartweik","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/hero","title":"Kir","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/first","title":"Recruiter","variant":""}],"title":"Related characters"},{"id":"inhabitant","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"creature/zonezero%20skeleton","title":"Child's skeleton","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/deer","title":"Deer","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zonezero%20human%20fighter3%20m","title":"Firez's guardsman","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zonezero%20human%20fighter1%20m","title":"Guard (variant 1)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zonezero%20human%20fighter2%20m","title":"Guard (variant 2)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/hare","title":"Hare","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zonezero%20rat","title":"Mouse","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zonezero%20toad","title":"Poisonous toad (variant 1)","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/bz1r%20human%20fighter%20m","title":"Recruiter","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zonezero%20succub","title":"Stone harpy","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zonezero%20scrab","title":"Young armadillo (variant 1)","variant":""}],"title":"Creatures and people"},{"id":"quest","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"quest/q1r","title":"A New Land","variant":""}],"title":"Quests"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Western castle outskirts</h1><p>To the east stands an impregnable castle, Jigran's stronghold. Its dungeons are the prison from which the hero escaped with such difficulty.</p><h2>Escape from Jigran</h2><p><a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, whose full name is Kir-A-Chit-La, is a young Joon enslaved under <a href=\"wiki://character/firez\">Firez</a> on <a href=\"wiki://allod/jigran\">Jigran</a>. He escapes the castle, leaving his family behind, and hopes to return with help. Outside the castle, a <a href=\"wiki://character/first\">recruiter</a> mistakes him for someone expected at the camp. Kir conceals his identity and accepts travel papers for work on Suslanger. The apparent opening to freedom instead delivers him to imperial authorities. <a href=\"wiki://character/hwleader\">Hartweik</a> dismisses his papers, treats him as a slave and considers reporting the red-skinned stranger for a reward. [1, 2, 3, 4]</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Based on the original dialogue, quest journals, event scripts and world descriptions. Source numbers identify the evidence listed below.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Sources</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/first\">Recruiter</a> (briefing brief_0)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hwleader\">Hartweik</a> (briefing brief_1)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/rick\">Tka Rik (Tka-Lithan Richti-Nik)</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_119)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>World description · Western castle outskirts (zone gz1g)</td></tr></table><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Island</td><td><a href=\"wiki://allod/jigran\">Jigran</a></td></tr></table><h2>Quests</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Quests</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/q1r\">A New Land</a></td></tr></table><h2>Related characters</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Related page</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/firez\">Firez</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/hwleader\">Hartweik</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/first\">Recruiter</a></td></tr></table><h2>Creatures and people</h2><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Related page</th><th>Details</th></tr><tr>